# OMG Tool Versions Example
# Compatible with mise, asdf, and other version managers
#
# This file locks runtime versions for your project.
# Place it in your project root to ensure all team members use the same versions.
#
# Usage:
#   omg use        # Auto-detects and activates versions from this file
#   omg env check  # Verifies current environment matches this file
#   omg env sync   # Installs missing versions and activates them

